  "Name": "PrintCaseLabel",
  "Description": "Print GS128 case labels\n\nTo print case labels with GS128 barcode for Walmarts Egg industry/fresh produce traceability requirement.  The labels are simply case labels with some production variables -they are not Tracking Entity labels\n\nCLR is used to print.  Label_MasterItem is redefined to bring in Optional Fields and joined with custom_CurrentCaseLabelVariables to include these variables.\nThere is a published Document accompanying this process with instructions,",
